%% Password reset token flow with expiry handling.
sequenceDiagram
actor User
participant Web
participant Account
participant TokenStore
participant Email
User->>Web: Request reset
Web->>Account: Find account
activate Account
Account->>TokenStore: Create token
TokenStore-->>Account: Token
Account->>Email: Send reset link
Email-->>User: Reset email
deactivate Account
User->>Web: Submit new password and token
Web->>Account: Reset password
activate Account
Account->>TokenStore: Validate token
alt [valid]
TokenStore-->>Account: Valid
Account->>Account: Hash and save password
Account-->>Web: Reset complete
else [expired]
TokenStore-->>Account: Expired
Account-->>Web: Request new link
end
deactivate Account
Web-->>User: Result
Note over Account,TokenStore: Tokens are single use
